{"title":"2001 SMT/Algebra Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT/Algebra_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/3/3e3428847b35b09cb78983db4d340fb553e378ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_A B + \\log_B A = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"158\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/c/35c6befbae2835211a36a77a5e2708937cc6faac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A&lt;B$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />, find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/c/90ce1667f4a2dbfd7c125fe0a2ca1004bfbf141b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_B A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT/Algebra_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/f/32f8ee02ac90cd143628cb7f6e045732daa8b3ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\log_B A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"88\" height=\"19\" />; then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/3/5b388b5aeb71207fcde7fa525eed81faa687d4f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{x}+x=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"82\" height=\"38\" />. From here we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/e/7eee35520fc4b97b9b09a5df420548b256e90da0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-3x+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"123\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/6/e36a4486af8d00455fc6e5f03074601386d4f86d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{3\\pm\\sqrt{5}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"96\" height=\"43\" />. Technically both solutions are possible even if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/c/35c6befbae2835211a36a77a5e2708937cc6faac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A&lt;B$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" /> (because of values less than 1); however, we assume that we are considering <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/4/66480e0e44d9188c8a17a5a54b55416c8aa8d9f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1&lt;A&lt;B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"88\" height=\"15\" />; then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/9/18943eb5071c9ed24decf38f1c821ee55c5a3bc8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\log_B A&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"121\" height=\"19\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/c/4cc054b09de881292843617a5c3d3af4e2b8e951.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\boxed{\\frac{3-\\sqrt{5}}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"107\" height=\"54\" />.\n</p><p>~ <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Eevee9406\">eevee9406</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017195532\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 44/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2033/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:31299:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017195532 and revision id 245504. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}